OL,3,ATwo police officers among seven dead
OL,4,Aafter car crash near Middlesbrough
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers are among seven
OL,7,Fpeople who have died in a crash
OL,8,Finvolving a police vehicle and a
OL,9,FVolkswagen Passat
OL,11,FThe collision happened on the A66 in
OL,12,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough in
OL,13,FTeesside, shortly after 03:30 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday
OL,16,FThe police watchdog, the IPOC, says it
OL,17,Fis investigating and understands
OL,18,FCleveland Police "sighted a suspicious
OL,19,Fvehicle and a pursuit began"
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
